{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>This day YHWH your Elohim commands you to do</b> — an allusion to what is said: \"and He gave them lands of nations… that they might keep His statutes and observe His laws.\"" "<b>with all your heart and with all your soul</b> — and juxtaposed to it: \"You have declared YHWH.\" For \"with all your heart and with all your soul\" is the Shema, for it is written in it \"with all your heart and with all your soul.\" And that is what we say: \"You have made me one band in the land\" — that is the Shema."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:10:45.341538124Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}